[4.721345, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.442488, "o", "── call 1: gotoAndWait — navigate + confirm the story list actually rendered ──\r\n"]
[6.213496, "o", "{\r\n  \"url\": \"https://news.ycombinator.com/\",\r\n  \"status\": 200,\r\n  \"ok\": true,\r\n  \"wait\": {\r\n    \"ok\": true\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n── call 2: one read to find the 3rd story's comments link ──\r\n(still needed — batch is query/text-based, resolved at execution time, not psychic;\r\n it can't target a dynamic per-story string it hasn't seen. This is the flow's one honest cost.)\r\n"]
[6.220991, "o", "target: \"75 comments\"\r\n\r\n── call 3: ONE veil_batch — click + wait + extract, in a single round-trip ──\r\n"]
[7.479556, "o", "{\r\n  \"ok\": true,\r\n  \"steps\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"action\": \"clickText\",\r\n      \"args\": {\r\n        \"query\": \"75 comments\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n      \"result\": {\r\n        \"i\": 0,\r\n        \"tag\": \"a\",\r\n        \"role\": \"\",\r\n        \"t\": \"75 comments\",\r\n        \"x\": 342,\r\n        \"y\": 134,\r\n        \"w\": 56,\r\n        \"h\": 10,\r\n        \"editable\": false\r\n      },\r\n      \"ms\": 783\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"action\": \"waitForText\",\r\n      \"args\": {\r\n        \"text\": \"comments\",\r\n        \"timeout\": 8000\r\n      },\r\n      \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n      \"ms\": 247\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"action\": \"extractMany\",\r\n      \"args\": {\r\n        \"fields\": {\r\n          \"commentCount\": \"comments\",\r\n          \"postedAgo\": \"ago\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n      \"result\": {\r\n        \"commentCount\": {\r\n          \"ok\": true,\r\n          \"value\": {\r\n            \"tag\": \"a\",\r\n            \"role\": \"\",\r\n            \"label\": \"comments\",\r\n            \"text\": \"comments\",\r\n            \"value\": null,\r\n            \"href\": \"newcomments\"\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        \"postedAgo\": {\r\n          \"ok\": true,\r\n          \"value\": {\r\n            \"tag\": \"a\",\r\n            \"role\": \"\",\r\n            \"label\": \"1 hour ago\",\r\n            \"text\": \"1 hour ago\",\r\n            \"value\": null,\r\n            \"href\": \"item?id=49503873\"\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"ms\": 34\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"action\": \"scroll\",\r\n      \"args\": {\r\n        \"dx\": 0,\r\n        \"dy\": -500\r\n      },\r\n      \"status\": \"ok\",\r\n      \"result\": {\r\n        \"moved\": false,\r\n        \"dx\": 0,\r\n        \"dy\": 0\r\n      },\r\n      \"ms\": 194\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\r\n── 3 MCP calls, 2038ms wall time — the same logical flow was 8 calls before phase-2 ──\r\n── scroll step's honest signal (moved:false) survived untouched inside batch.ok=true ──\r\n"]
[9.01547, "o", "\u001b[1;36m# every result above is real — including the honest moved:false on the scroll step,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.017835, "o", "\u001b[1;36m#   passed through batch untouched instead of a fake blanket 'ok'.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
